  <uml:Model xmi:id="model.parcel-delivery" name="Parcel delivery">
    <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="model.parcel-delivery.comment">
      <body>Logistics: a booked parcel is collected by a driver on its route, scanned in at the hub, may be held by customs, goes out for delivery and is delivered with proof, or returned to the sender after a failed attempt. Customs authority stays with customs officers.</body>
    </ownedComment>
